    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Gender and agreement",
     "texto": [
      "Polish nouns have grammatical gender. In the singular, the adjective changes depending on whether it is masculine, feminine or neuter.",
      "Polish has no word like «a» or «an» here: **nowy student**, **nowa nauczycielka**, **nowe dziecko** show agreement in the adjective."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
